            <ArticleTitle>Discovery of potent CRTh2 (DP2) receptor antagonists.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>4287-90</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Starting with the weak agonist indomethacin, a series of potent, selective CRTh2 (DP(2)) antagonists have been discovered as potential treatments for asthma, allergic rhinitis and other inflammatory diseases.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
